<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it upgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 9-1/4 to 32-3/4 after the company reported first quarter results below expectations.</p>
</text>
